// Anchor: TESTING.md ("hermetic + behavior-driven; heavy integration tests are exception") + THESIS.md L6 §181 + L7 §182 + impossible-bug enumeration §370-413 + memory: feedback_no_textual_enforcement_bridges (coverage is structural, not grep-enforced)
